WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:06.400
Forty-two million Americans face food insecurity. That's one in every eight households.

00:07.100 --> 00:11.900
At Langar One, we bring the grocery store to families who need it. Here's how.

00:12.600 --> 00:17.100
It starts with a simple request. A family fills out our form,

00:17.400 --> 00:21.000
or a partner agency reaches out for them.

00:22.600 --> 00:27.000
Next, we review the request, and confirm the family qualifies.

00:31.600 --> 00:38.600
Then, the groceries arrive. A real grocery shop, right at their door. And it never costs the family a thing.

00:42.100 --> 00:48.000
And we don't stop there. Deliveries continue for three months, and renew for as long as they're needed.

00:51.000 --> 00:55.500
Since 2021, over two thousand deliveries, across five states.

00:56.100 --> 00:59.900
Langar One. Ending hunger, one delivery at a time.
